    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "458004c2-2f2b-40bf-8fd7-cad968995e49",
      "key": "b694286b-5096-44fc-90ad-5002d24c7472",
      "values": []
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "a78052f5-1e62-46bc-8979-44a69e4a5ca8",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E4* hotel\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWelcome dinner\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFull programme of included excursions\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EProfessional local guide in Germany\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flights to Berlin\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coachin Germany\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOne free place per 10 paying passengers\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "What\u0027s included in this tour is entirely yours to customise to suit your group\u0027s budget and preferences. Here is what we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "2b089f73-6f05-4c18-8c2f-7a49a02e8abc",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EFour nights at the centrally located 4* Bilderberg Bellevue Hotel Dresden. Located by the River Elbe, facilities at the hotel include a restaurant, bar and swimming pool and all rooms are en suite. A welcome dinner is served in the hotel on the first evening and the remaining three nights are on bed and breakfast basis.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Where you stay is entirely yours to choose to match your group\u0027s preferences. Here is our suggested accommodation:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "652f514e-f416-4ecb-b3ad-399fa6946ce2",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Dresden\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENew Green Vault - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPillnitz Castle and Gardens - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETour of Saxony Switzerland\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ERiver Elbe cruise\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EZwinger Palace - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMei\u00DFen Porcelain Museum - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "The places your group visits are exclusively yours to decide. Here are the main sights we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "86d11607-ad33-46ba-8a57-23fc9c6f56d0",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EColditz Castle - a workhouse and mental institution for over 100 years, this Renaissance castle gained notoriety as a Nazi Germany prisoner of war camp\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMoritzburg Castle - this Baroque pleasure castle of Augustus the Strong was built in 1723 by the architect of the Dresden Zwinger to provide a magnificent setting for glittering parties\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECombine with a stay in Berlin - see The Art \u0026amp; History of Berlin \u0026amp; Potsdam\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "\nIf you\u0027d prefer to visit different places, or if you\u0027d like to add extra attractions that match your group\u0027s specific interests, here are some more suggestions:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "c3d3fa83-05a0-411a-854c-139a1bb4f5be",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 - UK to Dresden\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flight to Berlin - transfer with our guide in our private executive coach to the 4* Bilderberg Bellevue Hotel Dresden - dinner in our hotel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 - Dresden \u0026amp; New Green Vault\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Dresden taking in sights such as Semper Opera House, the Cathedral and a visit to the reconstructed Frauenkirche - guided tour of the Royal Palace and the New Green Vault with its collection of fine silver and jewellery.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 - Pillnitz Castle and Gardens, Saxony Switzerland \u0026amp; River Elbe cruise\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of the Chinese style Pillnitz Castle and Gardens, lying picturesquely on the banks of the River Elbe and with flying buttresses and chimneys ornamented with crowns - panoramic tour through the deeply cut Elbe Valley known as Saxony Switzerland taking in sights such as the Bastei Rocks and K\u00F6nigstein Fortress - paddle steamer cruise along the River Elbe from K\u00F6nigstein to Pirna to view the splendour of the Saxony Alps from a different perspective - optional tour and tasting at a carefully selected vineyard en route back to the hotel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 - Zwinger Palace\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of the Old Masters Picture Gallery in the Zwinger Palace, the old fortress of Dresden, introducing us to works by Rubens, Canaletto, Raphael, Titian, Rembrandt and Vermeer, as well as a wonderful Mei \u03B2en porcelain gallery.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 - Mei\u00DFen Porcelain Museum\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of the Mei\u00DFen Porcelain Museum gives an insight into the production process at this world renowned manufacturer - time at leisure in Mei\u00DFen where you may choose to visit Albrechtsburg Castle or the Gothic cathedral - transfer to Berlin Airport for our scheduled flight home.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Your itinerary is exclusively yours to tailor to suit your group\u0027s interests and profile of your members. Here is our suggested itinerary:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "Remember, every element of this itinerary can be adjusted. If you\u0027d like to change the days, add different activities, or adjust the pace, just let us know."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
